# Lumos AI Testing Intelligence Platform Rules

### **MIGRATION PATTERNS**
- **AI-Powered Error Analysis**: Multi-provider consensus with Neurolink SDK integration
- **Visual Test Debugging**: Playwright-based DOM capture and screenshot analysis  
- **Intelligent Test Validation**: Quality assessment with coverage gap detection
- **Pattern Learning Architecture**: SQLite-based error pattern storage and recognition

> **📚 Historical Learning Archive**: See `memory-bank/` for complete project context
> **🎯 Current Focus**: Enterprise-grade AI Testing Intelligence Platform

---

