### **Key Implementation Principles**
- **Multi-AI Consensus**: Leverage Neurolink SDK for multiple AI providers achieving >85% accuracy
- **Visual Evidence Collection**: Screenshot + DOM + console error capture with Playwright
- **Pattern Recognition**: SQLite-based learning from error patterns with confidence scoring
- **Community Solution Mining**: Stack Overflow + GitHub integration with AI-powered ranking
- **Real-time Analysis**: Complete error analysis in <30 seconds including web research

### **Component Relationships**
```
Error Input → Pattern Engine → AI Analysis → Web Research → Fix Suggestions
     ↓              ↓              ↓              ↓              ↓
[SQLite Cache]  [Neurolink SDK]  [Multi-AI]    [Community]    [Ranked Results]
     ↓              ↓              ↓              ↓              ↓
[Learning Loop] [Provider Pool]  [Consensus]   [Validation]   [User Feedback]
```

