## 🧪 AI TESTING STRATEGY

### **Testing Architecture**
```
Layer 1: Unit Tests → Vitest with 90%+ coverage targeting core logic
Layer 2: Integration Tests → AI provider integration with mock responses
Layer 3: E2E Tests → Playwright-based CLI command testing  
Layer 4: Demo Tests → Live error scenario validation with real AI
Layer 5: Performance Tests → <30 second analysis time validation
```

### **AI Testing Commands**
```bash
# Error analysis testing
npm run test                  # Full test suite including AI integration
lumos analyze --test-mode     # Test error classification without API calls

# AI provider testing
npm run test:ai               # Test Neurolink SDK integration
npm run test:patterns         # Validate pattern recognition accuracy
npm run test:research         # Test web research functionality

# Performance and benchmarking
npm run benchmark             # Performance benchmarking suite
lumos validate --benchmark    # Test validation performance
npm run health-check          # System health verification
```

### **Quality Metrics Validation**
```bash
# Success criteria validation (automated in CI)
npm run test:accuracy         # Validate >85% fix suggestion accuracy
npm run test:performance      # Ensure <30 second analysis time
npm run test:relevance        # Check >90% web research relevance
npm run test:false-positives  # Maintain <15% false positive rate
```

