## 🔐 AI PROVIDER CONFIGURATION

### **Environment Variables**
```bash
# Required AI provider API keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_key_here
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_key_here  
GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=your_google_ai_key_here

# Optional Lumos configurations
LUMOS_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.7           # Minimum confidence for suggestions
LUMOS_MAX_SUGGESTIONS=5                  # Maximum number of fix suggestions
LUMOS_RESEARCH_ENABLED=true              # Enable web research features
LUMOS_CACHE_DURATION=86400               # Pattern cache duration (seconds)
LUMOS_DEBUG_MODE=false                   # Enable debug logging
NODE_ENV=development                     # Environment mode
```

### **Configuration Files**
```bash
lumos.config.yaml             # Main Lumos configuration with AI settings
.env                          # Environment variables (never commit)
.env.example                  # Template for environment setup
playwright.config.ts          # Playwright testing configuration
tsconfig.json                 # TypeScript strict mode configuration
tsconfig.test.json            # Test-specific TypeScript config
vitest.config.ts              # Vitest testing framework setup
mkdocs.yml                    # Documentation site configuration
commitlint.config.js          # Commit message validation
```

