## ⚡ LUMOS SUCCESS FACTORS

### **Quality Metrics (Automated Validation)**
- **Fix Suggestion Accuracy**: >85% (suggestions lead to successful fixes)
- **Analysis Speed**: <30 seconds (complete workflow including web research)
- **Web Research Relevance**: >90% (results directly applicable to problem)
- **False Positive Rate**: <15% (suggestions are actionable and relevant)
- **Pattern Recognition**: >80% (correctly identifies known error patterns)
- **Code Coverage**: >90% (comprehensive test coverage)

### **Performance Targets (CI/CD Monitored)**
- **Error Classification**: <5 seconds (pattern recognition and categorization)
- **AI Analysis**: <15 seconds (multi-provider consensus building)
- **Web Research**: <10 seconds (community solution mining and ranking)
- **Visual Analysis**: <8 seconds (Playwright DOM capture and analysis)
- **Total End-to-End**: <30 seconds (complete analysis workflow)

### **Validation Pipeline**
```bash
# Complete Lumos validation (used in CI/CD)
npm install && \
npm run build && \
npm run lint && \
npm run typecheck && \
npm run test:coverage && \
npm run test:playwright && \
npm run benchmark
```

