## 🚀 ADVANCED LUMOS WORKFLOWS

### **Pattern Learning & Improvement**
```bash
# Train Lumos on your codebase patterns
lumos learn --source tests/demo/demo-outputs/ \
  --feedback positive \
  --update-patterns

# Export learned patterns for team sharing
lumos cache export --patterns team-patterns.json

# Import team patterns for consistency
lumos cache import --patterns team-patterns.json
```

### **Enterprise Integration**
```bash
# Jenkins integration for CI/CD
lumos analyze --jenkins-format \
  --input build-log.txt \
  --output jenkins-analysis.xml

# Slack/Teams notification integration
lumos analyze "Build failed: TypeError in UserService" \
  --notify slack \
  --channel #dev-alerts \
  --webhook $SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL
```

### **Multi-Project Configuration**
```bash
# Initialize for microservices architecture
lumos init --preset microservices \
  --projects frontend,backend,mobile \
  --shared-config

# Cross-project error correlation
lumos analyze --scope all-projects \
  --correlate-errors \
  --output correlation-report.json
```

